            <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">Validate your startup problem and its impact.</p>
            <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-border"></div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold relative z-10">1</div>
                  <div class="flex-1">
                          {{> question-block id="problem-validation-q1" step="1" question="Describe the problem your startup addresses." placeholder="This section validates your problem. Detail the specific challenge, affected people, scale, and urgency. AI can help refine problem statements. Use this section for problem-solution fit. Chat with AI to craft compelling problem descriptions or learn problem validation."}}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold relative z-10">2</div>
                  <div class="flex-1">
                          {{> question-block id="problem-validation-q2" step="2" question="Who is affected by this problem?" placeholder="This section identifies affected stakeholders. Describe demographics, characteristics, pain points, and impacts. AI can help develop customer personas. Use this section for target audience definition. Chat with AI to create detailed personas or understand stakeholder analysis."}}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold relative z-10">3</div>
                  <div class="flex-1">
                          {{> question-block id="problem-validation-q3" step="3" question="List your key assumptions." placeholder="This section lists key assumptions. Explain beliefs about problem, market, solution with evidence and risks. AI can help identify hidden assumptions. Use this section for validation planning. Chat with AI to learn assumption mapping or get validation strategies."}}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold relative z-10">4</div>
                  <div class="flex-1">
                          {{> question-block id="problem-validation-q4" step="4" question="Describe existing solutions." placeholder="This section analyzes existing solutions. Include direct competitors and workarounds with strengths, weaknesses, pricing. AI can help research alternatives. Use this section for competitive analysis. Chat with AI to discover solutions or get competitive intelligence."}}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold relative z-10">
                    <svg class="lucide lucide-check-circle w-8 h-8 text-success" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
                      <polyline points="22,4 12,14.01 9,11.01"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-1">
                    {{> move-next-block message="You have successfully completed this section of the idea model." buttonText="Move to Next Section"}}
